  "post_content": "<p>(14 fotos) V&iacute;ctor Olmos Torres, m&aacute;ster en investigaci&oacute;n e intervenci&oacute;n en Ciencias del Deporte y doctor en Piscolog&iacute;a, ha impartido este s&aacute;bado una charla en Onda sobre primeros auxilios b&aacute;sicos, motivaci&oacute;n en edad escolar y metodolog&iacute;a deportiva b&aacute;sica.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_7453.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La actividad estaba promovida por el Ayuntamiento, la Caja Rural y las AMPA, coorganizadoras de los Juevos Deportivos Escolares.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7450.jpg\" alt=\"img_7450\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7451.jpg\" alt=\"img_7451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7453.jpg\" alt=\"img_7453\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7455.jpg\" alt=\"img_7455\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7457.jpg\" alt=\"img_7457\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7459.jpg\" alt=\"img_7459\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7461.jpg\" alt=\"img_7461\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7462.jpg\" alt=\"img_7462\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7463.jpg\" alt=\"img_7463\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7464.jpg\" alt=\"img_7464\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7465.jpg\" alt=\"img_7465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7468.jpg\" alt=\"img_7468\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7469.jpg\" alt=\"img_7469\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaprimersauxilisesportescolar/img_7471.jpg\" alt=\"img_7471\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
